1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,780
The Little Prince and Qiqi flew and flew, still on their way home.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:08,259
They passed by a very bright planet.

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,019
There were so many sparkles everywhere.

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:17,940
"Wow, did the stars fall down?" Qiqi opened her eyes wide.

5
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,740
It wasn't stars at all.

6
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,740
It was a man wearing very shiny clothes.

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,180
With a super big hat on his head.

8
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,420
The hat was so bright it was dazzling.

9
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,340
"Hello! Do I look handsome?"

10
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,220
The man kept asking.

11
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:41,100
"Yes, you do." The Little Prince answered politely.

12
00:00:41,399 --> 00:00:47,460
"Then clap for me! More, more!" The man shouted excitedly.

13
00:00:47,759 --> 00:00:50,780
Qiqi curiously tried on that big hat.

14
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:55,859
When she put it on, a big mirror appeared in front of her.

15
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:59,259
But... the mirror only showed herself.

16
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:02,979
When Qiqi clapped, only she could hear it.

17
00:01:03,279 --> 00:01:08,559
When Qiqi said "how beautiful," only she answered herself.

18
00:01:08,859 --> 00:01:11,819
Qiqi pouted and took the hat off.

19
00:01:12,119 --> 00:01:15,699
"Praising yourself alone is so boring."

20
00:01:15,999 --> 00:01:18,059
The Little Prince thought and said:

21
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:24,419
"I have a rose. I praise her every day, and she praises me too."

22
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:27,979
"When you praise others, they'll praise you back."

23
00:01:28,279 --> 00:01:31,139
The man kept looking in the mirror endlessly.

24
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:35,899
"Praise me! Praise me!" he shouted loudly.

25
00:01:36,199 --> 00:01:38,659
But nobody passed by this planet.

26
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:42,459
Qiqi whispered to the Little Prince —

27
00:01:42,759 --> 00:01:47,059
"Only looking at yourself... wouldn't that be lonely?"

28
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:49,339
The Little Prince nodded.

29
00:01:49,639 --> 00:01:52,979
They held hands and gently flew away.

30
00:01:53,279 --> 00:01:57,339
The man was still shouting — "Do I look handsome?"

31
00:01:57,639 --> 00:02:00,179
But nobody could hear him anymore.

32
00:02:00,479 --> 00:02:03,179
Kids, who do you like to praise?

33
00:02:03,479 --> 00:02:05,299
Go praise your best friend~

